{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>前TVB花旦朱智賢（Ashley）憑無綫旅遊節目《3日2夜》彈起，不過性感形象背後卻隱藏着不少辛酸。近日她接受HOY TV節目《九運會客室2》主持伍詠薇及李凱賢（Brian）訪問時，首度大爆過往拍攝旅遊節目遇到不合理對待的黑歷史，驚爆曾被全男班攝製隊要求半裸浸溫泉，期間因怕側漏走光而企硬反抗，結果辣㷫導演，令當時還是新人的她委屈到匿埋房想喊！</p><figure><img alt=\"朱智賢爆拍旅遊節目黑歷史。（YouTube@HOY媒體網絡）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196908477071626240108642.jpeg/wyS8MueyAiIoN2J8P0k52vTC3GmlYx9JHjKzsB4ys7A\"/><figcaption>朱智賢爆拍旅遊節目黑歷史。（YouTube@HOY媒體網絡）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朱智賢曾被迫半裸浸溫泉。（YouTube@HOY媒體網絡）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196908471258189824765298.jpeg/6iGP0Jmk7turZUqPkUqRJOmNYmTblSSZ-1d1sftXdbE\"/><figcaption>朱智賢曾被迫半裸浸溫泉。（YouTube@HOY媒體網絡）</figcaption></figure><p>被迫半裸上陣　憂側漏走光崩潰：全部都係男人！</p><p>節目中，朱智賢大爆這段「唔想做但硬食」的委屈經歷。她憶述有次去台南拍攝，突然被帶到一個規定要全裸浸的溫泉，工作人員竟要求她只着泳褲上陣：「我就話吓點拍，『你着住條泳褲咪得囉』，我話唔得喎，咁會俾人鬧，呢度規矩係要（除晒）。佢哋話唔緊要，冇人嘅時候快快脆脆拍咗佢。」在追問下，朱智賢才驚覺「泳褲」的意思是「上面乜都唔着」，即是半裸上陣拍背脊！</p><p>起初她勉強答應，但臨門一腳卻驚覺不妥，她指着自己的胸側仔細形容當時的恐懼：「諗諗吓臨尾我就驚，唔係喎，好似唔係好對路喎，你話背脊啫，側少少都睇到㗎！」最令她崩潰的是當時的攝製隊陣容：「剛剛嗰個trip全部都係男士，一個女都冇，一個都冇！我問唔到人我有冇走光啊，即係我冇理由問個男士，你睇唔睇到呀！」</p><p>她直言感覺極不舒服：「我唔得喎，咁走光咁點呢？唔通佢睇到，佢又會同我講咩：『阿朱啊你露出嚟啊』，佢唔會㗎嘛！」當伍詠薇追問導演是否全部都是男士時，朱智賢激動強調重點：「全部都係男！我記得我有啲係着住比堅尼嘅，我都已經覺得好尷尬，因為我又問唔到佢哋，我有冇走光啊。」 此時，主持Brian一臉正經地搞笑神回：「如當時見到走光我會出聲。」</p><figure><img alt=\"一開始諗住就範。（YouTube@HOY媒體網絡）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196908626971987968958630.jpeg/cqle4t_SaAu3-0WJAbnU4eEAl3oQiDQLDtlK1w7ZStc\"/><figcaption>一開始諗住就範。（YouTube@HOY媒體網絡）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"越諗越唔對路。（YouTube@HOY媒體網絡）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196908624262336512913547.jpeg/PUduB-AAg5S6kuQqo0tozjMvesBqxOmSdWthx3VrYcc\"/><figcaption>越諗越唔對路。（YouTube@HOY媒體網絡）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"怕側邊走光。（YouTube@HOY媒體網絡）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196909200370962432143752.jpeg/_PfGCkhwKQAdQIhRA41Ih3naMCzhs4NIcb4K-XG-Cvk\"/><figcaption>怕側邊走光。（YouTube@HOY媒體網絡）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"在場全部男士，覺得冇人會話佢知走光。（YouTube@HOY媒體網絡）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196909197199937536864031.jpeg/Kq8PWFDH8ht18dvBTGs8JODDzPU_TvO5SBPxMkgT8TI\"/><figcaption>在場全部男士，覺得冇人會話佢知走光。（YouTube@HOY媒體網絡）</figcaption></figure><p>搬老竇出山反擊　委屈匿埋房想喊</p><p>為了脫身，朱智賢鼓起勇氣向導演說不：「我都係唔好啦咁樣。」結果惹來對方不滿：「跟住佢哋就嬲嬲地囉，話『頭先講咗拍㗎嘛，做乜又唔拍啊』。」為了企硬，她不惜搬出爸爸做擋箭牌，更反問男導演：「你自己都係人哋爸爸，你都應該明㗎」結果辣㷫對方，「佢着咗！其實我只係想佢imagine（幻想），如果嗰個係你個女，你都唔會想.......呢件事係咪要去到咁盡呢？」</p><p>雖然成功避過半裸危機，但當時身為新人的她卻承受着極大壓力：「最後係冇拍，我係好想喊嘅，但係我匿埋咗去房唔知點咁，因為好驚，當時係新人，你喺個group度又未拍完，你又reject咗佢哋，又唔知跟住會發生啲咩事。」</p><figure><img alt=\"朱智賢都擔心爸爸見到個女咁性感唔開心。（YouTube@HOY媒體網絡）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196909483771564032597813.jpeg/Y6lSTpLeojfxp7xM7LYumPlWrvtBoISPKPCFtSjwhbU\"/><figcaption>朱智賢都擔心爸爸見到個女咁性感唔開心。（YouTube@HOY媒體網絡）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Brian一本正經，夾雜粗口話如果當時在場，見到女仔走光會出聲。（YouTube@HOY媒體網絡）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196909403262160896836910.jpeg/E3J1tdIYdyBbuq8XzkYgRwygzcLEP2WDDuKPfg7ij34\"/><figcaption>Brian一本正經，夾雜粗口話如果當時在場，見到女仔走光會出聲。（YouTube@HOY媒體網絡）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"伍詠薇爆與蔡瀾拍男女一齊浸溫泉，對方係全裸。（YouTube@HOY媒體網絡）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196909397377290240743152.jpeg/Iu7DVbe9Hy3A6W0VsgS4TMdSA8yxoAzrvXxkib18ZIk\"/><figcaption>伍詠薇爆與蔡瀾拍男女一齊浸溫泉，對方係全裸。（YouTube@HOY媒體網絡）</figcaption></figure><p>潛水被迫唔拉拉鏈　拒為節目效果硬食</p><p>朱智賢承認《3日2夜》之所以為人熟識，是由於節目剛開始時部分女主持穿著泳裝而引起關注，逐漸令觀眾將節目與「泳裝」及「性感」掛鈎。這種既定印象亦影響了部分導演的拍攝方針，她亦曾在拍攝過程中遭遇過分要求。</p><p>朱智賢亦重提另一次「潛水衣事件」。當時換上潛水衣準備拍攝，卻被男導演要求不要拉上拉鏈：「佢話你記住呢，冇拉鏈喎，出到嚟先拉鏈。」她直言當下覺得極反感，怒斥該男導演不尊重女性：「我望住佢，變態㗎喎！」朱智賢表示明白節目效果的需要，但不認同必須以此等方式博取關注。她強調雙方應有商量空間，明言絕不會強迫自己接受不合理的要求，堅拒為博眼球而硬食。</p><figure><img alt=\"朱智賢拍《3日2夜》彈起。（IG@ashley_ellabel）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196909564621230080674231.jpeg/YyA3am5pgSGbr1B-dV7_lLxiFX3e3iHGn1UIip9VCIo\"/><figcaption>朱智賢拍《3日2夜》彈起。（IG@ashley_ellabel）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"身材勻稱。（IG@ashley_ellabel）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196909562335203328032689.jpeg/BVIevAD-p2yWlbsWizyYgMqai3jXM29PuO3wR7jt8Ec\"/><figcaption>身材勻稱。（IG@ashley_ellabel）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朱智賢靚相。（IG@ashley_ellabel）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196909559998844928576084.jpeg/-XL1ymGPHe6b81s8pffGTfxmjinMP0x7hNf8OYTX_Dk\"/><figcaption>朱智賢靚相。（IG@ashley_ellabel）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朱智賢靚相。（IG@ashley_ellabel）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196909719382396928063978.jpeg/9n5vfOFEIDr8d185_iJ_jDxMkbQx1GNvPLT0mjy09Jo\"/><figcaption>朱智賢靚相。（IG@ashley_ellabel）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朱智賢靚相。（IG@ashley_ellabel）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196909721706172416851937.jpeg/CVs-q9v2F5ZFtUMXeFluoora35hDE0BjvRvB170bwdc\"/><figcaption>朱智賢靚相。（IG@ashley_ellabel）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朱智賢靚相。（IG@ashley_ellabel）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196909723786678272023948.jpeg/YEp2HXvdjl-vjTRMWknbD8cbdEmlYqHlH77p3h--6d4\"/><figcaption>朱智賢靚相。（IG@ashley_ellabel）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朱智賢靚相。（IG@ashley_ellabel）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196909725892349952863724.jpeg/sEKhHYdr3nsZ8ff7QslPmlPqby_Tvg_OcDr4inA6-Io\"/><figcaption>朱智賢靚相。（IG@ashley_ellabel）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朱智賢靚相。（IG@ashley_ellabel）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196909728195153920473902.jpeg/WMbjwV_RxCE306GMyVBV3mGvfRAv5dL6q_fkSqv35Eo\"/><figcaption>朱智賢靚相。（IG@ashley_ellabel）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朱智賢靚相。（IG@ashley_ellabel）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196909719847964672132796.jpeg/h-d8DUk1G36NHQPxP5A4dNRrHWz5mOM86yFDZushQ2Y\"/><figcaption>朱智賢靚相。（IG@ashley_ellabel）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朱智賢靚相。（IG@ashley_ellabel）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196909722394038272419032.jpeg/AV6jlE7-mSxoFzsOtWyUYr_CteAZUCBSa9jy32vY8t8\"/><figcaption>朱智賢靚相。（IG@ashley_ellabel）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朱智賢靚相。（IG@ashley_ellabel）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196909725313404928193706.jpeg/85JNCqBhQ8sFEHQ8X2epy8nC0phYj_4vDX5XXg1-V14\"/><figcaption>朱智賢靚相。（IG@ashley_ellabel）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朱智賢靚相。（IG@ashley_ellabel）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196909727691706368950137.jpeg/Y-u6I7IfFe06SR7lUMoDQwiy2AbyDVwQPtBU4D7QVOA\"/><figcaption>朱智賢靚相。（IG@ashley_ellabel）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朱智賢靚相。（IG@ashley_ellabel）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196909730183254016745612.jpeg/-lM1KDwGJ_SWeJX36V1fefuozJ2WYxTkHZ0KSB2dCkg\"/><figcaption>朱智賢靚相。（IG@ashley_ellabel）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朱智賢靚相。（IG@ashley_ellabel）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196909720544219136693048.jpeg/k3_woivB1CuQ-JJrmkhd7N72cYLUk7eLsFS387BUt_M\"/><figcaption>朱智賢靚相。（IG@ashley_ellabel）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T16:03:14.156204+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1942,"images":23,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T15:45:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T23:22:27.715845+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T15:56:33.614263+00:00","content_hash":"8bf629423f6d3d5566fab42767dbd13ceaa78a286a66ef58c58bcc1422f92098","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}